The particle rendering in hooks/progress-visual.ts, the Braille particle grid
(hooks/pixels.ts) and the stage-pill glide are adapted from
zycck/claude-mods, plugins/plan-progress/hooks/register.tsx
https://github.com/zycck/claude-mods
Reference commit: e56018a17f403939979730cdb6d4aac4a96b72a2

Cobalt Cockpit has no runtime dependency on that project; the techniques were
reworked into its own design system (hooks/theme.ts) and its own mascot
(hooks/mascot.ts). No upstream code is vendored verbatim.

